{"relation_id": "REL-20261113-d82df3", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-ef449a"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-5d9c20"}, "note": "写しの機構（対合の特異性）と、写された内容の歴史（凍結事故）を対照。複写の忠実さと内容の偶然性は別の層にある。", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261113-f0c0e0", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-5d9c20"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-a6e8e2"}, "note": "内容と変換クラスの二層が、構造遺伝子と制御遺伝子の二重決定に対応する。", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261113-019446", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-a6e8e2"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-785651"}, "note": "分子の trans 信号（委託）と、個体の目標読み（他者）を対照。どちらも『読み』だが水準が違う。", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261113-6af121", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-785651"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-ccb434"}, "note": "他者目標の読みから、道徳的自己の系譜へ。心状態帰属の restraint が系譜の前提になる。", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261113-9bd4b4", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-ccb434"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-f7c146"}, "note": "道徳的自己の系譜（関係）と、解剖的位置（測定）を対照。人間の位置づけの二水準。", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261113-e7184c", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-f7c146"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-ee2393"}, "note": "位置づけが個体から系統へ、系統が交雑した混合へ拡張する。", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261113-eee09d", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-ee2393"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-f906e9"}, "note": "混合した系統（交雑）と、複製子の系統（存続）を対照。両方系統だが、混合と存続の次元が違う。", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261113-17dde6", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-f906e9"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-7a8f12"}, "note": "存続の単位が複製子から、書き換えられた環境（生態的継承）へと拡張される。", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261113-bd5d1f", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-7a8f12"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-c80200"}, "note": "環境の書き換え（能動）と、維持の系のfailure（老化）を対照。", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261113-24050d", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-ef449a"}, "relation_type": "metaphorically_resonates", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-c80200"}, "note": "複写の忠実さと維持の系は、書庫の保存と検証の二側面。", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261113-adce56", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-a6e8e2"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-7a8f12"}, "note": "制御の負債（誘導）が、生態的継承（書き換え）へと拡張される。", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261113-178f11", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-5d9c20"}, "relation_type": "metaphorically_resonates", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261113-f7c146"}, "note": "凍結した偶然（コード）と、測定された位置（人間）は、両方とも過去の選択が現在を拘束する形。", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z"}
